        "text_ywehQN": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><a href=\"https://www.tirerack.com/modalPopups/changeSearchLayer.jsp?shoppingFor=tire&filterBrand=Bridgestone\">Which Bridgestone tires are available for my vehicle?</a></p><p>When you purchase a set of four select Bridgestone tires you may be eligible to receive $70 back by mail on a Bridgestone Prepaid Mastercard®. Offer valid on tires purchased from Tire Rack’s in-stock inventory between 12:00 a.m. EDT May 1, 2025 and 11:59 p.m. EDT May 31, 2025.</p><p>Increase your rebate by $70 when you use your CFNA Credit Card or Bridgestone Tire Rack Credit Card. (Subject to credit approval)<br/><a href=\"https://www.tirerack.com/specialoffers/bridgestoneCC.jsp\" target=\"_blank\">Don’t have a card? Apply Now!</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.tirerack.com/ssl/modalboxAlerts/brandedCardTerms.jsp?promoID=B5127\" title=\"Bridgestone Tire Rack Credit Card Terms and Conditions\">CFNA Credit Card Terms & Conditions</a></p><p><em>Offer valid only in the 50 United States including the District of Columbia (includes APO/FPO addresses). The offer does not apply to Canadian residents. Void in Puerto Rico and where prohibited.</em></p>",
            "size": 75
          }
        },
